<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The lead you own {!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company} in the SGL Stage, with priority of {!Lead.Core_Lead_Priority__c} has not responded to your contact attempts</span></font><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;and is 21 days old.</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Click&nbsp;</span><a href="{!Lead.Link}"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">here</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></a><span style="font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">to visit this lead record in SFDC</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><div style="">Please process your lead by updating the Lead Status and Sub Status as soon as possible. If you have followed the 'New Contact Policy' and have attempted 12 activities to contact, then please disposition the Lead.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">Leads move to a terminated state if there is no activity for 30 days and 90 days since the creation date.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">Thank you.</div></font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>